***Phase 1 :***
*Listen to the commands:-

-Speech recognition using sr.
-Transcript the voice.
-Able to understand and interpret the spoken words.

*Speak in response:-

-ElevenLabs API to use realistics voices.
-Respend to the commands.

*Able to understand intent:-

-Entity-intent trained machine learning model.
-A text classification model that understands the intent (What user wants) and respond accordingly with entities (Optional)
-TF-IDF (Term Frequency and Inverse Document Frequency) for natural language processing(NLP).
   ->Converts text into numerical vextors.
   ->Helps to highlight key words.

***Phase 2 :***
*Context memory as short term intelligence:-
-Remembers the last command.
-Able to execute multiple commands based on the short term context memory.

***Phase 3 :***
*Long term memory:-
-Able adapt to you.
-Understand and remember your habits.

***Phase 4 :***
*Emotions detection:-
-Starts to understand how you feel.
-Respond to your feelings or mood in a similar way.
-Autonomous decision making based on the feelings or mood.

***Phase 5 :***
*Descision tree:-
-Decides what to do not just react.

***Phase 6 :***
*Adaptive learning:-
-Starts to learn from the habits.
-Implements commands frequency weighting.
-Srore correction for the mistake and adapt to better solutions over time.
